<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-W.P. 94-1 AT LUNCH AGAINST FREE STATE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-W.P. 94-1 AT LUNCH AGAINST FREE STATE.</headline>
<dateline>BLOEMFONTEIN 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Western Province, having been put into bat by Free State, were 94 for one at lunch on the opening day their four-day match at Springbok Park on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores:</p>
<p>Free State 94-1 (Sven Koening 45 not out, Jacques Kallis 42 not out)</p>
</text>
